(289,1,'Genesis','OT',11,22,'And Serug lived thirty years, and begat Nahor:'),
(290,1,'Genesis','OT',11,23,'And Serug lived after he begat Nahor two hundred years, and begat sons and daughters.'),
(291,1,'Genesis','OT',11,24,'And Nahor lived nine and twenty years, and begat Terah: {Terah: Gr. Thara}'),
(292,1,'Genesis','OT',11,25,'And Nahor lived after he begat Terah an hundred and nineteen years, and begat sons and daughters.'),
