(294,1,'Genesis','OT',11,27,'Now these {are} the generations of Terah: Terah begat Abram, Nahor, and Haran; and Haran begat Lot.'),
(295,1,'Genesis','OT',11,28,'And Haran died before his father Terah in the land of his nativity, in Ur of the Chaldees.'),
