(308,1,'Genesis','OT',12,9,'And Abram journeyed, going on still toward the south. {going...: Heb. in going and journeying}'),
(309,1,'Genesis','OT',12,10,'And there was a famine in the land: and Abram went down into Egypt to sojourn there; for the famine {was} grievous in the land.'),
