(324,1,'Genesis','OT',13,5,'And Lot also, which went with Abram, had flocks, and herds, and tents.'),
(325,1,'Genesis','OT',13,6,'And the land was not able to bear them, that they might dwell together: for their substance was great, so that they could not dwell together.'),
