(357,1,'Genesis','OT',14,20,'And blessed be the most high God, which hath delivered thine enemies into thy hand. And he gave him tithes of all.'),
(358,1,'Genesis','OT',14,21,'And the king of Sodom said unto Abram, Give me the persons, and take the goods to thyself. {persons: Heb. souls}'),
