(372,1,'Genesis','OT',15,11,'And when the fowls came down upon the carcases, Abram drove them away.'),
(373,1,'Genesis','OT',15,12,'And when the sun was going down, a deep sleep fell upon Abram; and, lo, an horror of great darkness fell upon him.'),
(374,1,'Genesis','OT',15,13,'And he said unto Abram, Know of a surety that thy seed shall be a stranger in a land {that is} not theirs, and shall serve them; and they shall afflict them four hundred years;'),
(375,1,'Genesis','OT',15,14,'And also that nation, whom they shall serve, will I judge: and afterward shall they come out with great substance.'),
