(406,1,'Genesis','OT',17,8,'And I will give unto thee, and to thy seed after thee, the land wherein thou art a stranger, all the land of Canaan, for an everlasting possession; and I will be their God. {wherein...: Heb. of thy sojournings}'),
(407,1,'Genesis','OT',17,9,'And God said unto Abraham, Thou shalt keep my covenant therefore, thou, and thy seed after thee in their generations.'),
