(409,1,'Genesis','OT',17,11,'And ye shall circumcise the flesh of your foreskin; and it shall be a token of the covenant betwixt me and you.'),
(410,1,'Genesis','OT',17,12,'And he that is eight days old shall be circumcised among you, every man child in your generations, he that is born in the house, or bought with money of any stranger, which {is} not of thy seed. {he that is eight...: Heb. a son of eight days}'),
