(421,1,'Genesis','OT',17,23,'And Abraham took Ishmael his son, and all that were born in his house, and all that were bought with his money, every male among the men of Abraham\'s house; and circumcised the flesh of their foreskin in the selfsame day, as God had said unto him.'),
