(1027,1,'Genesis','OT',35,15,'And Jacob called the name of the place where God spake with him, Bethel.'),
(1028,1,'Genesis','OT',35,16,'And they journeyed from Bethel; and there was but a little way to come to Ephrath: and Rachel travailed, and she had hard labour. {a little...: Heb. a little piece of ground}'),
(1029,1,'Genesis','OT',35,17,'And it came to pass, when she was in hard labour, that the midwife said unto her, Fear not; thou shalt have this son also.'),
(1030,1,'Genesis','OT',35,18,'And it came to pass, as her soul was in departing, (for she died) that she called his name Benoni: but his father called him Benjamin. {Benoni: that is, The son of my sorrow} {Benjamin: that is, The son of the right hand}'),
(1031,1,'Genesis','OT',35,19,'And Rachel died, and was buried in the way to Ephrath, which {is} Bethlehem.'),
(1032,1,'Genesis','OT',35,20,'And Jacob set a pillar upon her grave: that {is} the pillar of Rachel\'s grave unto this day.'),
(1033,1,'Genesis','OT',35,21,'And Israel journeyed, and spread his tent beyond the tower of Edar.'),
(1034,1,'Genesis','OT',35,22,'And it came to pass, when Israel dwelt in that land, that Reuben went and lay with Bilhah his father\'s concubine: and Israel heard {it}. Now the sons of Jacob were twelve:'),
(1035,1,'Genesis','OT',35,23,'The sons of Leah; Reuben, Jacob\'s firstborn, and Simeon, and Levi, and Judah, and Issachar, and Zebulun:'),
(1036,1,'Genesis','OT',35,24,'The sons of Rachel; Joseph, and Benjamin:'),
