(1057,1,'Genesis','OT',36,16,'Duke Korah, duke Gatam, {and} duke Amalek: these {are} the dukes {that came} of Eliphaz in the land of Edom; these {were} the sons of Adah.'),
(1058,1,'Genesis','OT',36,17,'And these {are} the sons of Reuel Esau\'s son; duke Nahath, duke Zerah, duke Shammah, duke Mizzah: these {are} the dukes {that came} of Reuel in the land of Edom; these {are} the sons of Bashemath Esau\'s wife.'),
(1059,1,'Genesis','OT',36,18,'And these {are} the sons of Aholibamah Esau\'s wife; duke Jeush, duke Jaalam, duke Korah: these {were} the dukes {that came} of Aholibamah the daughter of Anah, Esau\'s wife.'),
(1060,1,'Genesis','OT',36,19,'These {are} the sons of Esau, who {is} Edom, and these {are} their dukes.'),
