(1064,1,'Genesis','OT',36,23,'And the children of Shobal {were} these; Alvan, and Manahath, and Ebal, Shepho, and Onam. {Alvan: or, Alian} {Shepho: or, Shephi}'),
(1065,1,'Genesis','OT',36,24,'And these {are} the children of Zibeon; both Ajah, and Anah: this {was that} Anah that found the mules in the wilderness, as he fed the asses of Zibeon his father.'),
