(1075,1,'Genesis','OT',36,34,'And Jobab died, and Husham of the land of Temani reigned in his stead.'),
(1076,1,'Genesis','OT',36,35,'And Husham died, and Hadad the son of Bedad, who smote Midian in the field of Moab, reigned in his stead: and the name of his city {was} Avith.'),
