(1110,1,'Genesis','OT',37,26,'And Judah said unto his brethren, What profit {is it} if we slay our brother, and conceal his blood?'),
(1111,1,'Genesis','OT',37,27,'Come, and let us sell him to the Ishmeelites, and let not our hand be upon him; for he {is} our brother {and} our flesh. And his brethren were content. {were...: Heb. hearkened}'),
