(1114,1,'Genesis','OT',37,30,'And he returned unto his brethren, and said, The child {is} not; and I, whither shall I go?'),
(1115,1,'Genesis','OT',37,31,'And they took Joseph\'s coat, and killed a kid of the goats, and dipped the coat in the blood;'),
