(1124,1,'Genesis','OT',38,4,'And she conceived again, and bare a son; and she called his name Onan.'),
(1125,1,'Genesis','OT',38,5,'And she yet again conceived, and bare a son; and called his name Shelah: and he was at Chezib, when she bare him.'),
(1126,1,'Genesis','OT',38,6,'And Judah took a wife for Er his firstborn, whose name {was} Tamar.'),
(1127,1,'Genesis','OT',38,7,'And Er, Judah\'s firstborn, was wicked in the sight of the LORD; and the LORD slew him.'),
(1128,1,'Genesis','OT',38,8,'And Judah said unto Onan, Go in unto thy brother\'s wife, and marry her, and raise up seed to thy brother.'),
(1129,1,'Genesis','OT',38,9,'And Onan knew that the seed should not be his; and it came to pass, when he went in unto his brother\'s wife, that he spilled {it} on the ground, lest that he should give seed to his brother.'),
