(1876,2,'Exodus','OT',13,8,'And thou shalt shew thy son in that day, saying, {This is done} because of that {which} the LORD did unto me when I came forth out of Egypt.'),
(1877,2,'Exodus','OT',13,9,'And it shall be for a sign unto thee upon thine hand, and for a memorial between thine eyes, that the LORD\'S law may be in thy mouth: for with a strong hand hath the LORD brought thee out of Egypt.'),
