(1890,2,'Exodus','OT',13,22,'He took not away the pillar of the cloud by day, nor the pillar of fire by night, {from} before the people.'),
(1891,2,'Exodus','OT',14,1,'And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,'),
(1892,2,'Exodus','OT',14,2,'Speak unto the children of Israel, that they turn and encamp before Pihahiroth, between Migdol and the sea, over against Baalzephon: before it shall ye encamp by the sea.'),
