(2494,2,'Exodus','OT',33,20,'And he said, Thou canst not see my face: for there shall no man see me, and live.'),
(2495,2,'Exodus','OT',33,21,'And the LORD said, Behold, {there is} a place by me, and thou shalt stand upon a rock:'),
(2496,2,'Exodus','OT',33,22,'And it shall come to pass, while my glory passeth by, that I will put thee in a clift of the rock, and will cover thee with my hand while I pass by:'),
