(3693,4,'Numbers','OT',2,34,'And the children of Israel did according to all that the LORD commanded Moses: so they pitched by their standards, and so they set forward, every one after their families, according to the house of their fathers.'),
(3694,4,'Numbers','OT',3,1,'These also {are} the generations of Aaron and Moses in the day {that} the LORD spake with Moses in mount Sinai.'),
