(3697,4,'Numbers','OT',3,4,'And Nadab and Abihu died before the LORD, when they offered strange fire before the LORD, in the wilderness of Sinai, and they had no children: and Eleazar and Ithamar ministered in the priest\'s office in the sight of Aaron their father.'),
(3698,4,'Numbers','OT',3,5,'And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,'),
