(3701,4,'Numbers','OT',3,8,'And they shall keep all the instruments of the tabernacle of the congregation, and the charge of the children of Israel, to do the service of the tabernacle.'),
(3702,4,'Numbers','OT',3,9,'And thou shalt give the Levites unto Aaron and to his sons: they {are} wholly given unto him out of the children of Israel.'),
(3703,4,'Numbers','OT',3,10,'And thou shalt appoint Aaron and his sons, and they shall wait on their priest\'s office: and the stranger that cometh nigh shall be put to death.'),
(3704,4,'Numbers','OT',3,11,'And the LORD spake unto Moses, saying,'),
(3705,4,'Numbers','OT',3,12,'And I, behold, I have taken the Levites from among the children of Israel instead of all the firstborn that openeth the matrix among the children of Israel: therefore the Levites shall be mine;'),
(3706,4,'Numbers','OT',3,13,'Because all the firstborn {are} mine; {for} on the day that I smote all the firstborn in the land of Egypt I hallowed unto me all the firstborn in Israel, both man and beast: mine shall they be: I {am} the LORD.'),
(3707,4,'Numbers','OT',3,14,'And the LORD spake unto Moses in the wilderness of Sinai, saying,'),
