(4116,4,'Numbers','OT',14,7,'And they spake unto all the company of the children of Israel, saying, The land, which we passed through to search it, {is} an exceeding good land.'),
(4117,4,'Numbers','OT',14,8,'If the LORD delight in us, then he will bring us into this land, and give it us; a land which floweth with milk and honey.'),
(4118,4,'Numbers','OT',14,9,'Only rebel not ye against the LORD, neither fear ye the people of the land; for they {are} bread for us: their defence is departed from them, and the LORD {is} with us: fear them not. {defence: Heb. shadow}'),
