(4386,4,'Numbers','OT',22,10,'And Balaam said unto God, Balak the son of Zippor, king of Moab, hath sent unto me, {saying},'),
(4387,4,'Numbers','OT',22,11,'Behold, {there is} a people come out of Egypt, which covereth the face of the earth: come now, curse me them; peradventure I shall be able to overcome them, and drive them out. {I shall...: Heb. I shall prevail in fighting against him}'),
