(4446,4,'Numbers','OT',23,29,'And Balaam said unto Balak, Build me here seven altars, and prepare me here seven bullocks and seven rams.'),
(4447,4,'Numbers','OT',23,30,'And Balak did as Balaam had said, and offered a bullock and a ram on {every} altar.'),
