(4532,4,'Numbers','OT',26,42,'These {are} the sons of Dan after their families: of Shuham, the family of the Shuhamites. These {are} the families of Dan after their families. {Shuham: or, Hushim}'),
(4533,4,'Numbers','OT',26,43,'All the families of the Shuhamites, according to those that were numbered of them, {were} threescore and four thousand and four hundred.'),
