(4622,4,'Numbers','OT',29,13,'And ye shall offer a burnt offering, a sacrifice made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the LORD; thirteen young bullocks, two rams, {and} fourteen lambs of the first year; they shall be without blemish:'),
