(6286,6,'Joshua','OT',17,10,'Southward {it was} Ephraim\'s, and northward {it was} Manasseh\'s, and the sea is his border; and they met together in Asher on the north, and in Issachar on the east.'),
(6287,6,'Joshua','OT',17,11,'And Manasseh had in Issachar and in Asher Bethshean and her towns, and Ibleam and her towns, and the inhabitants of Dor and her towns, and the inhabitants of Endor and her towns, and the inhabitants of Taanach and her towns, and the inhabitants of Megiddo and her towns, {even} three countries.'),
