(7107,7,'Judges','OT',21,4,'And it came to pass on the morrow, that the people rose early, and built there an altar, and offered burnt offerings and peace offerings.'),
(7108,7,'Judges','OT',21,5,'And the children of Israel said, Who {is there} among all the tribes of Israel that came not up with the congregation unto the LORD? For they had made a great oath concerning him that came not up to the LORD to Mizpeh, saying, He shall surely be put to death.'),
(7109,7,'Judges','OT',21,6,'And the children of Israel repented them for Benjamin their brother, and said, There is one tribe cut off from Israel this day.'),
