(8910,11,'1 Kings','OT',6,12,'{Concerning} this house which thou art in building, if thou wilt walk in my statutes, and execute my judgments, and keep all my commandments to walk in them; then will I perform my word with thee, which I spake unto David thy father:'),
(8911,11,'1 Kings','OT',6,13,'And I will dwell among the children of Israel, and will not forsake my people Israel.'),
