(8950,11,'1 Kings','OT',7,14,'He {was} a widow\'s son of the tribe of Naphtali, and his father {was} a man of Tyre, a worker in brass: and he was filled with wisdom, and understanding, and cunning to work all works in brass. And he came to king Solomon, and wrought all his work. {a widow\'s...: Heb. the son of a widow woman}'),
