(8956,11,'1 Kings','OT',7,20,'And the chapiters upon the two pillars {had pomegranates} also above, over against the belly which {was} by the network: and the pomegranates {were} two hundred in rows round about upon the other chapiter.'),
(8957,11,'1 Kings','OT',7,21,'And he set up the pillars in the porch of the temple: and he set up the right pillar, and called the name thereof Jachin: and he set up the left pillar, and called the name thereof Boaz. {Jachin: that is, He shall establish} {Boaz: that is, In it is strength}'),
(8958,11,'1 Kings','OT',7,22,'And upon the top of the pillars {was} lily work: so was the work of the pillars finished.'),
(8959,11,'1 Kings','OT',7,23,'And he made a molten sea, ten cubits from the one brim to the other: {it was} round all about, and his height {was} five cubits: and a line of thirty cubits did compass it round about. {from...: Heb. from his brim to his brim}'),
