(8980,11,'1 Kings','OT',7,44,'And one sea, and twelve oxen under the sea;'),
(8981,11,'1 Kings','OT',7,45,'And the pots, and the shovels, and the basons: and all these vessels, which Hiram made to king Solomon for the house of the LORD, {were of} bright brass. {bright: Heb. made bright or, scoured}'),
