(9363,11,'1 Kings','OT',18,20,'So Ahab sent unto all the children of Israel, and gathered the prophets together unto mount Carmel.'),
(9364,11,'1 Kings','OT',18,21,'And Elijah came unto all the people, and said, How long halt ye between two opinions? if the LORD {be} God, follow him: but if Baal, {then} follow him. And the people answered him not a word. {opinions: or, thoughts}'),
(9365,11,'1 Kings','OT',18,22,'Then said Elijah unto the people, I, {even} I only, remain a prophet of the LORD; but Baal\'s prophets {are} four hundred and fifty men.'),
