(14873,19,'Psalms','OT',65,10,'Thou waterest the ridges thereof abundantly: thou settlest the furrows thereof: thou makest it soft with showers: thou blessest the springing thereof. {settlest: or, causest rain to descend into} {makest...: Heb. dissolvest it}'),
(14874,19,'Psalms','OT',65,11,'Thou crownest the year with thy goodness; and thy paths drop fatness. {with: Heb. of}'),
