(14977,19,'Psalms','OT',70,3,'Let them be turned back for a reward of their shame that say, Aha, aha.'),
(14978,19,'Psalms','OT',70,4,'Let all those that seek thee rejoice and be glad in thee: and let such as love thy salvation say continually, Let God be magnified.'),
(14979,19,'Psalms','OT',70,5,'But I {am} poor and needy: make haste unto me, O God: thou {art} my help and my deliverer; O LORD, make no tarrying.'),
