(15192,19,'Psalms','OT',79,4,'We are become a reproach to our neighbours, a scorn and derision to them that are round about us.'),
(15193,19,'Psalms','OT',79,5,'How long, LORD? wilt thou be angry for ever? shall thy jealousy burn like fire?'),
