(16544,20,'Proverbs','OT',6,1,'My son, if thou be surety for thy friend, {if} thou hast stricken thy hand with a stranger,'),
(16545,20,'Proverbs','OT',6,2,'Thou art snared with the words of thy mouth, thou art taken with the words of thy mouth.'),
(16546,20,'Proverbs','OT',6,3,'Do this now, my son, and deliver thyself, when thou art come into the hand of thy friend; go, humble thyself, and make sure thy friend. {and make...: or, so shalt thou prevail with thy friend}'),
