(16642,20,'Proverbs','OT',9,1,'Wisdom hath builded her house, she hath hewn out her seven pillars:'),
(16643,20,'Proverbs','OT',9,2,'She hath killed her beasts; she hath mingled her wine; she hath also furnished her table. {her beasts: Heb. her killing}'),
