(18094,23,'Isaiah','OT',23,14,'Howl, ye ships of Tarshish: for your strength is laid waste.'),
(18095,23,'Isaiah','OT',23,15,'And it shall come to pass in that day, that Tyre shall be forgotten seventy years, according to the days of one king: after the end of seventy years shall Tyre sing as an harlot. {shall Tyre...: Heb. it shall be unto Tyre as the song of an harlot}'),
