(19175,24,'Jeremiah','OT',8,19,'Behold the voice of the cry of the daughter of my people because of them that dwell in a far country: {Is} not the LORD in Zion? {is} not her king in her? Why have they provoked me to anger with their graven images, {and} with strange vanities? {them...: Heb. the country of them that are far off}'),
(19176,24,'Jeremiah','OT',8,20,'The harvest is past, the summer is ended, and we are not saved.'),
(19177,24,'Jeremiah','OT',8,21,'For the hurt of the daughter of my people am I hurt; I am black; astonishment hath taken hold on me.'),
(19178,24,'Jeremiah','OT',8,22,'{Is there} no balm in Gilead; {is there} no physician there? why then is not the health of the daughter of my people recovered? {recovered: Heb. gone up?}'),
