(19204,24,'Jeremiah','OT',9,26,'Egypt, and Judah, and Edom, and the children of Ammon, and Moab, and all {that are} in the utmost corners, that dwell in the wilderness: for all {these} nations {are} uncircumcised, and all the house of Israel {are} uncircumcised in the heart. {in the utmost...: Heb. cut off into corners, or, having the corners of their hair polled}'),
(19205,24,'Jeremiah','OT',10,1,'Hear ye the word which the LORD speaketh unto you, O house of Israel:'),
