(20676,26,'Ezekiel','OT',11,18,'And they shall come thither, and they shall take away all the detestable things thereof and all the abominations thereof from thence.'),
(20677,26,'Ezekiel','OT',11,19,'And I will give them one heart, and I will put a new spirit within you; and I will take the stony heart out of their flesh, and will give them an heart of flesh:'),
