(21476,26,'Ezekiel','OT',39,25,'Therefore thus saith the Lord GOD; Now will I bring again the captivity of Jacob, and have mercy upon the whole house of Israel, and will be jealous for my holy name;'),
(21477,26,'Ezekiel','OT',39,26,'After that they have borne their shame, and all their trespasses whereby they have trespassed against me, when they dwelt safely in their land, and none made {them} afraid.'),
