(23413,40,'Matthew','NT',9,32,'As they went out, behold, they brought to him a dumb man possessed with a devil.'),
(23414,40,'Matthew','NT',9,33,'And when the devil was cast out, the dumb spake: and the multitudes marvelled, saying, It was never so seen in Israel.'),
