(23752,40,'Matthew','NT',18,23,'Therefore is the kingdom of heaven likened unto a certain king, which would take account of his servants.'),
(23753,40,'Matthew','NT',18,24,'And when he had begun to reckon, one was brought unto him, which owed him ten thousand talents. {talents: a talent is seven hundred and fifty ounces of silver, which after five shillings the ounce is pounds shillings}'),
