(23817,40,'Matthew','NT',20,23,'And he saith unto them, Ye shall drink indeed of my cup, and be baptized with the baptism that I am baptized with: but to sit on my right hand, and on my left, is not mine to give, but {it shall be given to them} for whom it is prepared of my Father.'),
(23818,40,'Matthew','NT',20,24,'And when the ten heard {it}, they were moved with indignation against the two brethren.'),
