(23873,40,'Matthew','NT',21,45,'And when the chief priests and Pharisees had heard his parables, they perceived that he spake of them.'),
(23874,40,'Matthew','NT',21,46,'But when they sought to lay hands on him, they feared the multitude, because they took him for a prophet.'),
(23875,40,'Matthew','NT',22,1,'The kingdom of heaven is like unto a certain king, which made a marriage for his son,'),
(23876,40,'Matthew','NT',22,2,'And sent forth his servants to call them that were bidden to the wedding: and they would not come.'),
