(25203,42,'Luke','NT',7,11,'And it came to pass the day after, that he went into a city called Nain; and many of his disciples went with him, and much people.'),
(25204,42,'Luke','NT',7,12,'Now when he came nigh to the gate of the city, behold, there was a dead man carried out, the only son of his mother, and she was a widow: and much people of the city was with her.'),
(25205,42,'Luke','NT',7,13,'And when the Lord saw her, he had compassion on her, and said unto her, Weep not.'),
