(25207,42,'Luke','NT',7,15,'And he that was dead sat up, and began to speak. And he delivered him to his mother.'),
(25208,42,'Luke','NT',7,16,'And there came a fear on all: and they glorified God, saying, That a great prophet is risen up among us; and, That God hath visited his people.'),
