(27023,44,'Acts','NT',4,4,'Howbeit many of them which heard the word believed; and the number of the men was about five thousand.'),
(27024,44,'Acts','NT',4,5,'And it came to pass on the morrow, that their rulers, and elders, and scribes,'),
(27025,44,'Acts','NT',4,6,'And Annas the high priest, and Caiaphas, and John, and Alexander, and as many as were of the kindred of the high priest, were gathered together at Jerusalem.'),
(27026,44,'Acts','NT',4,7,'And when they had set them in the midst, they asked, By what power, or by what name, have ye done this?'),
