(27061,44,'Acts','NT',5,5,'And Ananias hearing these words fell down, and gave up the ghost: and great fear came on all them that heard these things.'),
(27062,44,'Acts','NT',5,6,'And the young men arose, wound him up, and carried {him} out, and buried {him}.'),
(27063,44,'Acts','NT',5,7,'And it was about the space of three hours after, when his wife, not knowing what was done, came in.'),
