(27660,44,'Acts','NT',20,37,'And they all wept sore, and fell on Paul\'s neck, and kissed him,'),
(27661,44,'Acts','NT',20,38,'Sorrowing most of all for the words which he spake, that they should see his face no more. And they accompanied him unto the ship.'),
(27662,44,'Acts','NT',21,1,'And it came to pass, that after we were gotten from them, and had launched, we came with a straight course unto Coos, and the {day} following unto Rhodes, and from thence unto Patara:'),
(27663,44,'Acts','NT',21,2,'And finding a ship sailing over unto Phenicia, we went aboard, and set forth.'),
