(27667,44,'Acts','NT',21,6,'And when we had taken our leave one of another, we took ship; and they returned home again.'),
(27668,44,'Acts','NT',21,7,'And when we had finished {our} course from Tyre, we came to Ptolemais, and saluted the brethren, and abode with them one day.'),
(27669,44,'Acts','NT',21,8,'And the next {day} we that were of Paul\'s company departed, and came unto Caesarea: and we entered into the house of Philip the evangelist, which was {one} of the seven; and abode with him.'),
(27670,44,'Acts','NT',21,9,'And the same man had four daughters, virgins, which did prophesy.'),
