(27672,44,'Acts','NT',21,11,'And when he was come unto us, he took Paul\'s girdle, and bound his own hands and feet, and said, Thus saith the Holy Ghost, So shall the Jews at Jerusalem bind the man that owneth this girdle, and shall deliver {him} into the hands of the Gentiles.'),
(27673,44,'Acts','NT',21,12,'And when we heard these things, both we, and they of that place, besought him not to go up to Jerusalem.'),
