(27679,44,'Acts','NT',21,18,'And the {day} following Paul went in with us unto James; and all the elders were present.'),
(27680,44,'Acts','NT',21,19,'And when he had saluted them, he declared particularly what things God had wrought among the Gentiles by his ministry.'),
