(27704,44,'Acts','NT',22,3,'I am verily a man {which am} a Jew, born in Tarsus, {a city} in Cilicia, yet brought up in this city at the feet of Gamaliel, {and} taught according to the perfect manner of the law of the fathers, and was zealous toward God, as ye all are this day.'),
(27705,44,'Acts','NT',22,4,'And I persecuted this way unto the death, binding and delivering into prisons both men and women.'),
