(27876,44,'Acts','NT',27,24,'Saying, Fear not, Paul; thou must be brought before Caesar: and, lo, God hath given thee all them that sail with thee.'),
(27877,44,'Acts','NT',27,25,'Wherefore, sirs, be of good cheer: for I believe God, that it shall be even as it was told me.'),
(27878,44,'Acts','NT',27,26,'Howbeit we must be cast upon a certain island.'),
