(28896,47,'2 Corinthians','NT',6,1,'We then, {as} workers together {with him}, beseech {you} also that ye receive not the grace of God in vain.'),
(28897,47,'2 Corinthians','NT',6,2,'(For he saith, I have heard thee in a time accepted, and in the day of salvation have I succoured thee: behold, now {is} the accepted time; behold, now {is} the day of salvation.)'),
(28898,47,'2 Corinthians','NT',6,3,'Giving no offence in any thing, that the ministry be not blamed:'),
